  unitName: Duel-GX II
  unitId: 60254
  unitNumber: 357
  description: A mechanical figure that appeared in Grand Gaia to defeat that which
    destroyed the world in which it was created. It came to be known by the pet name
    Crab by Michele and the rest of those around it. Despite his emotionless nature
    as a mechanical figure, when his friends were in danger he drastically changed.
    As she looked upon his incredibly powerful new form, Michele smiled bitterly
    as she said, "You were cuter as a 'crab' than you are now as a 'scorpion!'"
  summonDesc: DEFENSE TARGET CONFIRMED.<br>REMOVING ENEMY TARGETS.
  fusionDesc: MAINTENANCE COMPLETE.<br>MAX OUTPUT INCREASED.
  evoDesc: UNEXPECTED ERROR.<br>VERSION UPGRADE<br>COMMENCING.
